      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This game was created by Mohammad Farhadi and AmirHossein Alipour,\nas
    the AP Project (2nd Semester, Computer Engineering)\nat Shahid Beheshti University.\n\nIt
    stands as the result of months of effort,\nsleepless nights, and the love we
    poured into it.\n\nThe game still has room to grow\ncountless bugs to  be fix
    *killed* ,\nlore left untold, and levels yet to be built.\nBut we think it\u2019s
    time to finish this\u2026 and finally call it a game.\n\nThanks to everyone who
    helped us along the way,\nand special thanks to the creators whose assets we
    used *stole*.\n\nWe hope you enjoy playing,\nand that it brings you both fun
    and escape. :)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
